Giving out the solutions or even partial solutions to quests 
is illegal.  The only exception to this rule is when several 
players party together and work as a team to solve it.  
Since this information is actually learned together, it's not
considered giving out solutions. If on the other hand, you work
together for a while as a team then disband the party and one 
or more players go off to do other things, any information 
learned after that point falls under the first rule, and cannot 
be shared. Players caught giving out solutions to quests will 
receive anywhere from a 1 level demotion all the way to a demotion
to level 1 for a serious offense.
